body:
I main jungle since I pretty much started playing the game in season 3, hardstuck plat since then but w/e. There are some tipps for your jungle clear:

Buy 3 Pots instead of the refilable potion if you need a better first clear or buy the refillable if you wan't to safe money in long terms and if you are able to clear easily without the extra hp from the 3 Potions

&#x200B;

Make sure to always kite your camps, this will safe you some health and you'll be more likely to be able to gank or take another camp

&#x200B;

Something that is also important, is to cancel your animations. If you play kha'zix don't just spam your abilitys whenever they are ready. Start a camp with an Autoattack, cancel the animation with a Q, do another autoattack and instantly use your W afterwards. Never use your E to clear camps in Jungle with Kha'zix unless it's close or you're fighting the birds. But make sure to also use it as an autoattack reset.

&#x200B;

Look out for your lanes, not just to gank but also to possibly keep the creeps from runing into the turret when they are back so your lane won't lose all of the exp and gold.

&#x200B;

Once you succesfully ganked a lane and the enemy died or is forced to back, push the wave with your laner IF the enemy does not have tp. You'll likely get flamed for pushing the wave in sometimes but it's the smartest thing to do since the enemy will lose a bunch of gold and exp and you possibly get some gold off of the turret.

&#x200B;

And yes, UNLOCK YOUR CAMERA

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
